config BR2_PACKAGE_CHERRY_PIT
	bool "cherry-pit"
	help
	  The /init of Cherry's initramfs: it mounts the root
	  filesystem, a compressed EROFS image in the initramfs,
	  straight from the file, gives it a tmpfs /run with the UKI's
	  PCR signature and public key, which systemd-stub left in the
	  initramfs, and runs the /init of that root.

	  A static binary, installed to the images directory, where
	  post-image.sh packs it into the initramfs.
